      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/cowrie/cowrie/zipball/v3.1.8",
      "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(shell): match bash and coreutils for break, closed stdout, logout, ls, file errors and function arguments by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40763\n* build(deps-dev): bump tox from 4.67.5 to 4.67.13 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40764\n* build(deps-dev): bump coverage from 7.17.0 to 7.17.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40765\n* build(deps-dev): bump ruff from 0.17.3 to 0.17.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40768\n* build(deps): bump docker/login-action from 4.7.0 to 4.8.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40770\n* build(deps): bump sigstore/cosign-installer from 4.1.2 to 4.1.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40769\n* build(deps-dev): bump libvirt-python from 12.8.0 to 12.9.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40766\n* fix(auth): refuse logins whose username contains a slash by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40772\n* fix(wc): count and print the way GNU wc does by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40771\n* fix(proc): report the reading process in /proc/self and remove Docker files by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40773\n* fix(free): show the emulated machine's memory, laid out as on Debian 12 by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40774\n* fix(rmq): pass type checking with pika 1.5 by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40775\n* build(deps): bump pymisp from 2.5.34.4 to 3.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40767\n* fix: stop forwarding after a rejected or malformed CONNECT response by @SAY-5 in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40586\n* fix(ssh): read the whole proxy reply before opening a tunnel by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40777\n* fix: escape line breaks in console event messages by @kunaldrafts25 in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40677\n* fix(events): escape control characters in cowrie.log lines by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40778\n* fix(tftp): close the artifact when shutdown interrupts a transfer by @Shellghostt in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40779\n* ci: test on Python 3.16 alpha, allowed to fail by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40781\n\n## New Contributors\n* @SAY-5 made their first contribution in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40586\n* @Shellghostt made their first contribution in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40779\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/compare/v3.1.7...v3.1.8",
