      "body": "## What's Changed\n* build(deps-dev): bump ruff from 0.17.2 to 0.17.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40752\n* build(deps-dev): bump pipdeptree from 4.2.9 to 4.2.13 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40751\n* build(deps-dev): bump mypy from 2.4.0 to 2.4.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40750\n* build(deps-dev): bump tox from 4.67.1 to 4.67.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40748\n* build(deps): bump aiokafka from 0.14.0 to 0.15.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40749\n* fix(find): list symlinks without following them by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40757\n* perf(find): walk directory nodes instead of looking up each path by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40758\n* fix(pool): handle pool messages split across reads or sent together by @sudu787 in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40754\n* fix(grep): make -c print the number of matching lines by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40761\n* fix(mkdir): support -p, -v and -m like GNU mkdir by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40760\n* feat(ssh): send stderr on its own SSH stream and run shells without a pty like sshd by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40762\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/compare/v3.1.6...v3.1.7",
