      "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(ssh): answer unexpected key exchange messages with SSH_MSG_UNIMPLEMENTED by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40725\n* build(deps): bump setuptools from 84.1.0 to 84.2.1 in /docs by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40734\n* build(deps): bump actions/setup-python from 7.0.0 to 7.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40733\n* build(deps): bump pypa/gh-action-pypi-publish from 1.14.2 to 1.14.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40732\n* build(deps): bump docker/login-action from 4.6.0 to 4.7.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40731\n* build(deps): bump txmongo from 25.0.0 to 26.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40730\n* build(deps-dev): bump coverage from 7.16.2 to 7.17.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40729\n* build(deps): bump mysql-connector-python from 26.7.0 to 26.10.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40727\n* build(deps-dev): bump ruff from 0.17.1 to 0.17.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40726\n* fix(printf): cap the output one invocation builds in memory by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40738\n* fix(ttylog): limit TTY log size and keep sessions running when the disk is full by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40739\n* docs(changelog): one section per release from 3.0.1, plus Unreleased by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40740\n* build(docs): update Sphinx to 9.2.0 and build Read the Docs with Python 3.13 by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40741\n* build(deps): bump setuptools from 84.1.0 to 84.2.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40728\n* test(insults): fix mypy errors in the TTY log recording tests by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40742\n* style: run ruff format on src by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40743\n* fix(shell): stop a command's timers when it exits, so Ctrl-C returns a clean prompt by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40747\n* fix(proxy): forward telnet input sent before the backend connects, and hold early traffic in one queue per direction by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40745\n* fix(ssh): stop processing a client's packets once the server drops it by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40744\n* fix(telnet-proxy): stop logging and leaking the attacker's password, and track the login as one phase by @micheloosterhof in https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/pull/40746\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/cowrie/cowrie/compare/v3.1.5...v3.1.6",
